{"code":0,"data":{"title":"vivo小游戏账号接入流程","content":"<p>备注：详细了解vivo小游戏账号接入流程&amp;技术问题，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://minigame.vivo.com.cn/documents/#/lesson/open-ability/newaccount\">请点击</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 id=\"s-s0kmxnw4\">【接入流程】</h3><p>1、进入<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/manageCenter\">管理中心</a>，点击小游戏，进入页面后点击创建小游戏。</p><h2 id=\"s-makrnkro\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220930/01d85l/20220930162003948926.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"285\" data-natural-width=\"1052\" data-natural-height=\"375\" data-type=\"image\"></h2><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220930/ug1bqi/20220930164446184214.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"1400\" height=\"160\" data-natural-width=\"1868\" data-natural-height=\"213\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p><p>2、填写小游戏名称、包名，上传图标后点击立即创建。</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220930/0tr3cq/20220930162418623493.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"1400\" height=\"533\" data-natural-width=\"1889\" data-natural-height=\"719\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p><p>3、在小游戏详情页中点击账号服务，在此页面中可查看cpid，appid，appsecret，并点击立即启用按钮填写回调地址，回调地址需以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，若有多个回调地址则使用半角符号 | 分隔 如 http://www.abc.com|https://www.abc.com</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20250508/vryxms/20250508161414573851.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"165\" data-natural-width=\"1129\" data-natural-height=\"216\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20230908/0x1n6h/20230908160604258417.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"650\" height=\"421\" data-natural-width=\"743\" data-natural-height=\"481\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220930/42i0e1/20220930163417889595.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-natural-width=\"664\" data-natural-height=\"317\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p><p>4、按照上方接入文档接入完成后，在小游戏详情页中点击完善信息，提交rpk包并完善相关信息，审核通过后即可上线。</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20250508/bwfv3t/20250508161639001092.png\" data-natural-width=\"1901\" data-natural-height=\"489\" data-type=\"image\"></p>","versionCode":11,"updateTime":1712042186000,"breadCrumbs":"小游戏管理,技术文档,小游戏账号接入流程","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}